# Google OAuth Test Endpoints

### 1. Initiate Google OAuth Login
GET http://localhost:3001/auth/google

### 2. Google OAuth Callback (This will be called by Google)
# GET http://localhost:3001/auth/google/callback

### 3. Test accessing protected route after Google login
GET http://localhost:3001/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Test refresh token (if you have cookies set)
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}